   "install": {
    "title": "Install",
    "html": "<p>The installer supports macOS, Linux, and Windows. It provisions a supported Node.js runtime when needed.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># macOS / Linux / WSL2\ncurl -fsSL https://openclaw.ai/install.sh | bash\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-powershell\"># Windows PowerShell\niwr -useb https://openclaw.ai/install.ps1 | iex\n</code></pre>\n<p>Already manage Node.js? Install the published package instead (Node 24.16.0+ on 24.x or 26.1.0+; 24.22.1+/26.12.1+ strongly recommended for security):</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npm install -g openclaw@latest --allow-scripts=openclaw\n</code></pre>\n<p>That command is for npm 12 or npm 11.16+. On npm 11.15 and earlier, omit\n<code>--allow-scripts=openclaw</code>. See the\n<a href=\"https://docs.openclaw.ai/install\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">installation guide</a> for the lifecycle script\ncontract, Docker, Nix, and other deployment paths.</p>",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 743
